  "description": "Click here and download the Caples font · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Dive headfirst into the digital age with Caples, a bold, high-contrast display font that perfectly captures the nostalgic, liquid essence of the Y2K aesthetic and modern street style.\n\nCaples is a Y2K high-contrast display font that brings back the glossy, futuristic drama of early 2000s design. Its bold curves, razor-sharp edges, and playful proportions give your lettering that iconic tech-girly vibe that defined the era. Perfect for posters, branding, logos, album covers, stickers, and anything that deserves a nostalgic punch.\n\nThis unique typeface stands out with its exceptionally rounded, chunky forms and deep, dramatic contrast in stroke thickness—noticeable in the subtle thins against the massive, bubble-like bolds, which create a captivating visual tension. Its low x-height and close-knit letterforms give it a compact, groovy, and unapologetically retro-futuristic feel.\n\nFeaturing 212 unique glyphs, Caples is designed to be a centerpiece, making it ideal for music album covers, video game branding, edgy fashion editorials, experimental poster design, and bold social media graphics that demand attention.\n\nUse it to instantly evoke the era of chunky tech, early internet graphics, and a vibe that is simultaneously playful, vintage, and high-energy.",
